{% doc %}
  One laundry care symbol and what it means, such as Machine wash cold, drawn as a filled glyph in the current text
  color. The symbols match the Icon/Care set in FencingClubWebsite.pen. Renders nothing for a name it doesn't know, so
  a mistyped value in a product's care symbols never shows an empty tile.

  @param {string} symbol - wash-cold, line-dry, no-bleach, no-tumble-dry, no-iron or no-dry-clean.
  @param {number} [glyph_size] - The glyph's size in pixels. Default: 24.

  @example
  {% render 'ui-care-symbol', symbol: 'wash-cold' %}
{% enddoc %}
